#. module: erplibre_sign_oca_signature_stamp
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:erplibre_sign_oca_signature_stamp.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"Inside the box shrinks the signature to make room; below the box keeps it "
"and writes the lines under the box, over what the document shows there."
msgstr ""
"Dans la case, la signature rétrécit pour faire place aux lignes ; sous la "
"case, elle garde sa taille et les lignes s'écrivent sous la case, par-dessus"
" ce que le document y montre."

#. module: erplibre_sign_oca_signature_stamp
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:erplibre_sign_oca_signature_stamp.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Lines Placement"
msgstr "Placement des lignes"

